    "# Hedged US–Korea–Japan Multi-Asset Portfolio: screen, valuation and optimisation\n",
    "\n",
    "**Author:** Jung Ryul · FMBA (Finance & Business Analytics), SKK GSB\n",
    "**Data:** Stock Analysis statistics pages for 300 stocks, 22–28 Sep 2026 · **Base currency:** KRW\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook reproduces every number in the report:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Parse the raw multiples for the 300-stock universe (≈100 largest per market)\n",
    "2. **Screen** on earnings yield, FCF yield and ROE ÷ P/B, then **value** 112 names with one model per business type\n",
