    "5. Stress tests and the comparison with 1/N, max-Sharpe, minimum variance and risk parity\n",
    "\n",
    "Run from the repository root (`jupyter notebook notebook/Portfolio_Screen_and_Optimization.ipynb`); paths below are relative to it."
