    "## 4 · Risk model: 10 factors\n",
    "\n",
    "A 46×46 sample covariance matrix has 1,035 correlations and would be very noisy. Instead:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\Sigma = B\\,F\\,B^\\top + D$$\n",
    "\n",
